--- !u!114 &453460245
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 453460244}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 70efc77d5dbc6984a96bfaa1705a4f63, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  ui: {fileID: 1301415532}
  steps:
  - type: 2
    text: Hola Bienvenido a Creed Burger
    icon: {fileID: 1915461190, guid: d9a4a8d035bac134eab733bc50eaa129, type: 3}
    point: {fileID: 0}
    client: {fileID: 0}
    recipeId: 0
    seconds: 5
    enableOnEnter:
    - {fileID: 0}
    disableOnEnter: []
    autoDisablePreviousMarkers: 1
  - type: 2
    text: "Yo te ense\xF1are lo basico"
    icon: {fileID: 1788761426, guid: d9a4a8d035bac134eab733bc50eaa129, type: 3}
    point: {fileID: 0}
    client: {fileID: 0}
    recipeId: 0
    seconds: 3
    enableOnEnter: []
    disableOnEnter: []
    autoDisablePreviousMarkers: 1
  - type: 0
    text: Primero acercate al cliente que tienes a tu derecha
    icon: {fileID: 1915461190, guid: d9a4a8d035bac134eab733bc50eaa129, type: 3}
    point: {fileID: 3544261478713977963}
    client: {fileID: 0}
    recipeId: 0
    seconds: 0
    enableOnEnter:
    - {fileID: 1895537091}
    disableOnEnter: []
    autoDisablePreviousMarkers: 1
  - type: 2
    text: Apreta la tecla E y asesinalo
    icon: {fileID: 642877294, guid: 8b63a904cd5184d4d90c1d1b0f55db80, type: 3}
    point: {fileID: 0}
    client: {fileID: 0}
    recipeId: 0
    seconds: 2
    enableOnEnter: []
    disableOnEnter: []
    autoDisablePreviousMarkers: 1
  - type: 2
    text: Igualmente con Q pones trampa que te ayudaran a cazarlos
    icon: {fileID: 1915461190, guid: d9a4a8d035bac134eab733bc50eaa129, type: 3}
    point: {fileID: 0}
    client: {fileID: 0}
    recipeId: 0
    seconds: 5
    enableOnEnter: []
    disableOnEnter: []
    autoDisablePreviousMarkers: 1
  - type: 2
    text: E igual puedes limpiar la sangre con la E
    icon: {fileID: 1788761426, guid: d9a4a8d035bac134eab733bc50eaa129, type: 3}
    point: {fileID: 0}
    client: {fileID: 0}
    recipeId: 0
    seconds: 3
    enableOnEnter: []
    disableOnEnter: []
    autoDisablePreviousMarkers: 1
  - type: 0
    text: Ocupa con E su carne que solto y llevalo a la maquina trituradora  que
      esta a tu izquierda
    icon: {fileID: 1915461190, guid: d9a4a8d035bac134eab733bc50eaa129, type: 3}
    point: {fileID: 1464491342}
    client: {fileID: 0}
    recipeId: 0
    seconds: 0
    enableOnEnter:
    - {fileID: 540036089}
    disableOnEnter: []
    autoDisablePreviousMarkers: 1
  - type: 2
    text: 'Apreta la E y procesa la carne para tener una que podras usar '
    icon: {fileID: 1915461190, guid: d9a4a8d035bac134eab733bc50eaa129, type: 3}
    point: {fileID: 0}
    client: {fileID: 0}
    recipeId: 0
    seconds: 3
    enableOnEnter: []
    disableOnEnter: []
    autoDisablePreviousMarkers: 1
  - type: 0
    text: 'Asi mismo agarra la cubeta de panes que tienes a tu derecha '
    icon: {fileID: 1788761426, guid: d9a4a8d035bac134eab733bc50eaa129, type: 3}
    point: {fileID: 872951995}
    client: {fileID: 0}
    recipeId: 0
    seconds: 0
    enableOnEnter:
    - {fileID: 191979911}
    disableOnEnter: []
    autoDisablePreviousMarkers: 1
  - type: 2
    text: Acercate a la carne, sueltala y haras una hamburguesa basica
    icon: {fileID: 1788761426, guid: d9a4a8d035bac134eab733bc50eaa129, type: 3}
    point: {fileID: 0}
    client: {fileID: 0}
    recipeId: 0
    seconds: 5
    enableOnEnter:
    - {fileID: 0}
    disableOnEnter: []
    autoDisablePreviousMarkers: 1
  - type: 1
    text: Ahora ve y apreta E para  entregarsela a tu cliente que esta esperando
      enfrente
    icon: {fileID: 1915461190, guid: d9a4a8d035bac134eab733bc50eaa129, type: 3}
    point: {fileID: 0}
    client: {fileID: 383877184}
    recipeId: 3
    seconds: 5
    enableOnEnter:
    - {fileID: 1380011273}
    - {fileID: 383877176}
    disableOnEnter: []
    autoDisablePreviousMarkers: 1
  playerTag: Player
  findPlayerEvery: 0.25
  tutorialFinishedPanel: {fileID: 854338682}
